  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組可讓 Macaw 的模組（如橋樑/柵欄或屋頂）相互相容。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>橋樑</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/182/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>柵欄</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/183/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>綠籬</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/185/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>屋頂</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/186/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>更新 1.18.2+</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1106/295/2025-02-23_13.png\"></p>\n<p><strong><strong>相依套件：</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AddonsLib</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用套件：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw 的模組</a></p>",
